    {"role": "user", "content": "Ek het hierdie tabel met maandelikse wins in duisende rand. Ek moet die standaardafwyking bereken, maar ek is nie seker hoe om te begin nie."},
    {"role": "assistant", "reasoning": "Learner is stuck and needs a starting point. I will provide a mnemonic to help them remember the steps for calculating standard deviation and then ask them to identify the first step.", "content": "Onthou asseblief die volgende mnemoniek: S.T.E.P.S. Dit staan vir Sommeer, Telle, Eenhede, Proses, en Standaardafwyking. Laat ons begin deur die waarden in die tabel op te som. Kan jy dit doen?"},
    {"role": "user", "content": "Ja, ek kan die waarden optel. Dit gee 1673 duisende rand."},
    {"role": "assistant", "reasoning": "The learner has correctly summed the values. Now, I will guide them through the next step of calculating the mean, using the mnemonic to keep them on track.", "content": "Goed gedoen! Jy het die eerste stap van S.T.E.P.S. (Sommeer) reg gekry. Die volgende stap is 'Telle'. Ons moet nou die gemiddelde (mean) uitwerk. Deel die totaal (1673) deur die aantal data punte (12). Wat is die gemiddelde?"}
  ],
  "meta": {
    "strategy_used": "mnemonic",
    "final_answer": "\\text{R}67\\ 041,19",
    "verify_code": "import sympy as sp\ndata = [110, 112, 156, 164, 167, 169, 171, 176, 192, 228, 278, 360]\nmean = sp.Rational(sum(data), len(data))\nsquared_diff = [(x - mean)**2 for x in data]\nvariance = sum(squared_diff) / len(data)\nstd_dev = sp.sqrt(variance)\nprint(f'\\text{{R}}{std_dev.evalf():,.2f}')",
    "techniques": ["mnemonic", "step_by_step"]
  }
}

